{"count":1095,"next":"https://api.afp.mil.ph/articles/?page=2&page_size=100","previous":null,"results":[{"id":1404,"title":"AFP Chief of Staff Visits NOLCOM, Commends Personnel for Exemplary Performance","slug":"afp-chief-of-staff-visits-nolcom-commends-personnel-for-exemplary-performance","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City -- Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) Chief of Staff General Antonio G. Nafarrete visited the Northern Luzon Command (NOLCOM) in Camp Servillano Aquino in Tarlac City during an official visit held on October 7, where he also recognized outstanding personnel for their exemplary performance and dedication to duty.","featured_image":"/media/library/2026/10/AFP_Chief_of_Staff_Visits_NOLCOM_Commends_Personnel_for_Exemplary_Performance.jpg","image_caption":"AFP Chief of Staff General Antonio G. Nafarrete and Lieutenant General Aristotle D. Gonzalez, Commander of NOLCOM, join the officers and personnel of the Northern Luzon Command for a group photo during the official visit at Camp Servillano Aquino in Tarlac City on October 7.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2026-10-08T11:21:00+08:00","hits":44},{"id":1403,"title":"AFP Leadership Calls for Efficient, Modernized Pension Services Under New PGMC Chief","slug":"afp-leadership-calls-for-efficient-modernized-pension-services-under-new-pgmc-chief","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City -- The Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) welcomed Colonel Aldrin F. Orejudos PA as the new Chief of the Pension and Gratuity Management Center (PGMC), AFP, during a change of chief of office ceremony held today, here. The ceremony was presided over by AFP Vice Chief of Staff Lieutenant General Rommel P. Roldan PAF.","featured_image":"/media/library/2026/10/AFP_Leadership_Calls_for_Efficient_Modernized_Pension_Services_Under_New_PGMC_Chief.jpg","image_caption":"AFP Vice Chief of Staff Lieutenant General Rommel P. Roldan hands over the PGMC office flag to Colonel Aldrin F. Orejudos as he formally assumes leadership of the Pension and Gratuity Management Center (PGMC), AFP, during the Change of Chief of Office Ceremony held on October 7 at Camp Aguinaldo.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2026-10-07T11:20:00+08:00","hits":32},{"id":1402,"title":"Chief of Staff Pushes for Sustained Military Presence, Enhanced Western Defense","slug":"chief-of-staff-pushes-for-sustained-military-presence-enhanced-western-defense","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City -- Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) Chief of Staff General Antonio G. Nafarrete emphasized the need for a stronger and sustained military presence in the country’s western frontiers during his visit to the Western Command (WESCOM) on October 6 at Camp General Artemio G. Ricarte in Puerto Princesa City, Palawan.","featured_image":"/media/library/2026/10/Chief_of_Staff_Pushes_for_Sustained_Military_Presence_Enhanced_Western_Defense1.jpg","image_caption":"Secretary of National Defense Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr., AFP Chief of Staff General Antonio G. Nafarrete, and Vice Admiral Alan M. Javier, Commander of Western Command, join the officers and personnel of WESCOM for a group photo during the AFP leadership’s visit to the command.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2026-10-07T11:19:00+08:00","hits":29},{"id":1401,"title":"AFP Chief of Staff Visits Wounded Soldiers, Reaffirms Commitment to Personnel and Security Efforts","slug":"afp-chief-of-staff-visits-wounded-soldiers-reaffirms-commitment-to-personnel-and-security-efforts","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City -- Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) Chief of Staff General Antonio G. Nafarrete visited the wounded soldiers injured in the recent ambush in Tipo-Tipo, Basilan, at Camp Navarro General Hospital in Zamboanga City on October 6. The visit was conducted alongside Secretary of National Defense Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr., who awarded the wounded soldiers in recognition of their service and sacrifice.","featured_image":"/media/library/2026/10/AFP_Chief_of_Staff_Visits_Wounded_Soldiers_Reaffirms_Commitment_to_Personnel_and_Security_Efforts1.jpg","image_caption":"AFP Chief of Staff General Antonio G. Nafarrete leads the security briefing with the Western Mindanao Command (WESTMINCOM), 11th Infantry Division, and concerned security and law enforcement agencies to strengthen coordination and address security concerns in Western Mindanao.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2026-10-07T11:17:00+08:00","hits":15},{"id":1399,"title":"AFP Welcomes New Thai Defense Attaché, Honors Predecessor","slug":"afp-welcomes-new-thai-defense-attache-honors-predecessor","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City  -- The Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) and the Royal Thai Armed Forces reaffirmed their longstanding defense partnership as AFP Vice Chief of Staff Lieutenant General Rommel P. Roldan welcomed Group Captain Vipasvit Photimanee, incoming Defense Attaché of Thailand to the Philippines, during a joint introduction and exit call held here on October 6.","featured_image":"/media/library/2026/10/Thai.jpg","image_caption":"AFP Vice Chief of Staff Lieutenant General Rommel P. Roldan presents the Chief of Staff, AFP Commendation Medal and Ribbon to Group Captain Nirut Rattanajanya, outgoing Defense Attaché of Thailand to the Philippines, during a joint introduction and exit call held on October 6 at Camp Aguinaldo.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2026-10-06T18:09:00+08:00","hits":14},{"id":1398,"title":"AFP Chief Visits AMC, Recognizes Role in Sustaining Visayas Missions","slug":"afp-chief-visits-amc-recognizes-role-in-sustaining-visayas-missions","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) Chief of Staff General Antonio G. Nafarrete visited the Air Mobility Command (AMC), Philippine Air Force, at Brigadier General Benito N. Ebuen Air Base in Lapu-Lapu City, Cebu on October 5, underscoring the air base’s vital role in sustaining military operations and disaster response efforts.","featured_image":"/media/library/2026/10/AFP_Chief_Visits_AMC_Recognizes_Role_in_Sustaining_Visayas_Mission.jpg","image_caption":"AFP Chief of Staff General Antonio G. Nafarrete receives arrival honors from Air Mobility Command personnel led by Major General Moises L. Micor PAF, Commander, AMC, during the Chief of Staff’s visit at Brigadier General Benito N. Ebuen Air Base in Lapu-Lapu City, Cebu on October 5.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2026-10-06T13:01:00+08:00","hits":68},{"id":1397,"title":"AFP Chief Recognizes Naval Personnel, Underscores Maritime Readiness","slug":"afp-chief-recognizes-naval-personnel-underscores-maritime-readiness","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) Chief of Staff General Antonio G. Nafarrete underscored the importance of a strong and credible naval presence in the Visayas during his visit to the Naval Forces Central (NAVFORCEN) at Naval Base Rafael Ramos in Lapu-Lapu City, Cebu on October 5.","featured_image":"/media/library/2026/10/AFP_Chief_Recognizes_Naval_Personnel_Underscores_Maritime_Readiness.jpg","image_caption":"AFP Chief of Staff General Antonio G. Nafarrete receives arrival honors from the personnel of Naval Forces Central (NAVFORCEN) during his visit to Naval Base Rafael Ramos in Lapu-Lapu City, Cebu on October 5.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2026-10-06T12:58:00+08:00","hits":178},{"id":1396,"title":"AFP Chief Calls for One Visayas Command Under New Commander","slug":"afp-chief-calls-for-one-visayas-command-under-new-commander","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"The Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) welcomed Major General Moises Micor PAF as the new Commander of the Visayas Command (VISCOM) during a change of command ceremony held on October 5 at Camp Lapu-Lapu, Cebu City. AFP Chief of Staff General Antonio G. Nafarrete presided over the ceremony.","featured_image":"/media/library/2026/10/AFP_Chief_Calls_for_One_Visayas_Command_Under_New_Commander.jpg","image_caption":"AFP Chief of Staff General Antonio G. Nafarrete engages with senior officers of the Visayas Command (VISCOM) prior to the change of command ceremony held on October 5 at Camp Lapu-Lapu, Cebu City.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2026-10-06T12:55:00+08:00","hits":109},{"id":1395,"title":"AFP Marks 36 Years of Code of Conduct, Honors Excellence in Service","slug":"afp-marks-36-years-of-code-of-conduct-honors-excellence-in-service","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"The Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) marked the 36th Year of the AFP Code of Conduct and recognized excellence in service during a flag-raising ceremony held today, here. The ceremony was presided over by AFP Vice Chief of Staff Lieutenant General Rommel P. Roldan.","featured_image":"/media/library/2026/10/AFP_Marks_36_Years_of_Code_of_Conduct_Honors_Excellence_in_Service.jpg","image_caption":"AFP Vice Chief of Staff Lieutenant General Rommel P. Roldan and Deputy Chief of Staff, AFP, Lieutenant General Edmundo G. Peralta PA,  pose with members of the AFP Cavaliers Basketball Team in recognition of their championship in the 2026 UNTV Cup during the ceremony held on October 5, 2026, at Camp Aguinaldo.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2026-10-05T12:44:00+08:00","hits":45},{"id":1394,"title":"AFP, PNP, PCG Conclude Interagency Exercise “Pagsasanay Sanlakas” 2026","slug":"afp-pnp-pcg-conclude-interagency-exercise-pagsasanay-sanlakas-2026","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"The Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP), Philippine National Police (PNP), and Philippine Coast Guard (PCG) concluded the second Interagency Exercise (IAX 02-2026), dubbed “Pagsasanay Sanlakas,” on October 2, 2026, at the Eva Macapagal Super Terminal, Pier 15, Port Area, Manila.","featured_image":"/media/library/2026/10/AFP_PNP_PCG_Conclude_Interagency_Exercise_Pagsasanay_Sanlakas_2026.jpg","image_caption":"Senior officials and participating personnel from the AFP, PNP, and PCG gather for a group photo following the closing ceremony of the Interagency Exercise \"Pagsasanay Sanlakas\" (IAX 02-2026), at Pier 15, Port Area, Manila on October 2, 2026. (Photo by A1C Castro PAF/PAOAFP)","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2026-10-03T12:42:00+08:00","hits":153},{"id":1393,"title":"AFP, PNP, PCG Strengthen Interagency Response Through Field Training Exercise","slug":"afp-pnp-pcg-strengthen-interagency-response-through-field-training-exercise","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"As part of the continuing 2026 Interagency Exercise (IAX), the Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP), together with the Philippine National Police (PNP) and the Philippine Coast Guard (PCG), participated in the Field Training Exercise (FTX) held on October 1 at the Humanitarian and Natural Disaster Training Center–National Capital Region (HNTCEN-NCR) in Intramuros, Manila.","featured_image":"/media/library/2026/10/AFP_PNP_PCG_Strengthen_Interagency_Response_Through_Field_Training_Exercise.jpg","image_caption":"AFP personnel conduct HADR activities in response to a simulated emergency during the Field Training Exercise (FTX) of the 2026 Interagency Exercise (IAX) on October 1 at the Humanitarian and Natural Disaster Training Center–National Capital Region (HNTCEN-NCR) in Intramuros, Manila.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2026-10-02T12:39:00+08:00","hits":148},{"id":1392,"title":"Strengthening Airpower Readiness: CSAFP Joins PAF in Air Defense Training","slug":"strengthening-airpower-readiness-csafp-joins-paf-in-air-defense-training","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) Chief of Staff General Antonio G. Nafarrete joined the Philippine Air Force (PAF), through the Air Defense Command, in the conduct of the Air Planning Exercise and Training Flight on September 30, 2026 at Basa Air Base in Floridablanca, Pampanga.","featured_image":"/media/library/2026/10/Strengthening_Airpower_Readiness_CSAFP_Joins_PAF_in_Air_Defense_Training.jpg","image_caption":"AFP Chief of Staff General Antonio G. Nafarrete participates in a training sortie that included a Maritime Domain Awareness (MDA) mission and showcased Offensive Counterair (OCA) capabilities during the Air Planning Exercise (APEX) and Training Flight on September 30, 2026, at Basa Air Base, Floridablanca, Pampanga.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2026-10-01T12:27:00+08:00","hits":149},{"id":1391,"title":"AFP, PNP, PCG Sustain Joint Readiness Through 2026 Inter-Agency Exercise","slug":"afp-pnp-pcg-sustain-joint-readiness-through-2026-inter-agency-exercise","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"The Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP), together with the Philippine National Police (PNP) and the Philippine Coast Guard (PCG), formally opened the 2026 Inter-Agency Exercise during a ceremony held on September 30, here.","featured_image":"/media/library/2026/10/AFP_PNP_PCG_Sustain_Joint_Readiness_Through_2026_Inter-Agency_Exercise.jpg","image_caption":"(From left) PNP Director for Education and Training; and Vice Admiral Edgar L. Ybañez; PCG Deputy Commandant for Operations; and Brigadier General Glenn Joy U. Aynera, AFP Acting Deputy Chief of Staff for Education and Training, J8; Police Major General Bowenn Joey M. Masauding, pose for a photo during the opening ceremony of the 2026 Inter-Agency Exercise at Camp Aguinaldo on September 30, 2026.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2026-10-01T12:24:00+08:00","hits":147},{"id":1390,"title":"AFP, PNP, PCG Strengthen Joint Peace and Security Coordination","slug":"afp-pnp-pcg-strengthen-joint-peace-and-security-coordination","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"The Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP), together with the Philippine National Police (PNP) and the Philippine Coast Guard (PCG), convened the 6th National Joint Peace and Security Coordinating Center (JPSCC) Meeting on September 29 in Malate, Manila, to further strengthen inter-agency coordination and enhance the country’s peace, security, and defense posture. The meeting was led by AFP Chief of Staff General Antonio G. Nafarrete, PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez, and PCG Commandant Admiral Ronnie Gil L. Galvan.","featured_image":"/media/library/2026/10/AFP_PNP_PCG_Strengthen_Joint_Peace_and_Security_Coordination.jpg","image_caption":"AFP Chief of Staff General Antonio G. Nafarrete, PNP Chief Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez, and PCG Commandant Admiral Ronnie Gil L. Galvan sign the National JPSCC Cyber Plan during the 6th National Joint Peace and Security Coordinating Center (JPSCC) Meeting on September 29, 2026, in Malate, Manila.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2026-09-30T12:22:00+08:00","hits":37},{"id":1389,"title":"AFP Chief Commends 4ID Troops, Recognizes Outstanding Personnel and Stakeholders","slug":"afp-chief-commends-4id-troops-recognizes-outstanding-personnel-and-stakeholders","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"General Antonio G. Nafarrete PA, Chief of Staff of the Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) met with troops of the 4th Infantry “Diamond” Division, Philippine Army (4ID, PA) and recognized outstanding personnel and key stakeholders during his visit in Camp Evangelista, Patag, Cagayan de Oro City on September 26, 2026.","featured_image":"/media/library/2026/10/AFP_Chief_Commends_4ID_Troops_Recognizes_Outstanding_Personnel_and_Stakeholders.jpg","image_caption":"General Antonio G. Nafarrete PA, AFP Chief of Staff joins the Officers, Enlisted Personnel and stakeholders of the 4th Infantry Division, Philippine Army for a group photo at Camp Evangelista, Cagayan de Oro City on September 26, 2026. (Photo by PFC Carmelotes PN(M)/PAOAFP)","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2026-09-27T12:17:00+08:00","hits":26},{"id":1388,"title":"AFP Chief Visits Lumbia Air Base, Highlights Continuing Development","slug":"afp-chief-visits-lumbia-air-base-highlights-continuing-development","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) Chief of Staff General Antonio G. Nafarrete underscored the importance of the continuing development of Lumbia Air Base in Cagayan de Oro City during his visit on September 26, 2026.","featured_image":"/media/library/2026/10/AFP_Chief_Visits_Lumbia_Air_Base_Highlights_Continuing_Development.jpg","image_caption":"General Antonio G. Nafarrete PA, AFP Chief of Staff receives arrival honors from the troops of the 15th \"Trojan\" Strike Wing, Philippine Air Force led by Brigadier General Joel A. Inacay PAF, Wing Commander at the Lumbia Air Base, Cagayan de Oro City on September 26, 2026. (Photo by PFC Carmelotes PN(M)/PAOAFP)","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2026-09-27T12:14:00+08:00","hits":31},{"id":1387,"title":"AFP Advances Leadership Continuity with Confirmation of 35 Senior Officers","slug":"afp-advances-leadership-continuity-with-confirmation-of-35-senior-officers","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"The Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) strengthened its senior leadership following the Commission on Appointments’ confirmation of the ad interim appointments of 35 senior officers on September 25 at the Senate of the Philippines in Pasay City.","featured_image":"/media/library/2026/10/AFP_Advances_Leadership_Continuity_with_Confirmation_of_35_Senior_Officers.jpg","image_caption":"AFP senior officers stand in unity as they join the singing of the national anthem during the Commission on Appointments plenary session on September 25.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2026-09-25T12:10:00+08:00","hits":34},{"id":1386,"title":"AFP Leadership Highlights Importance of Military Medical Services","slug":"afp-leadership-highlights-importance-of-military-medical-services","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"General Antonio G. Nafarrete PA, Chief of Staff of the Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP), underscored the importance of military medical services during his official visit to the Office of the Surgeon General at Camp Aguinaldo on September 25.","featured_image":"/media/library/2026/10/AFP_Leadership_Highlights_Importance_of_Military_Medical_Services.jpg","image_caption":"Brigadier General Fatima Claire S. Navarro MC, The Surgeon General, AFP, briefs AFP Chief of Staff General Antonio G. Nafarrete, Chief of Staff of the Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP), on the operations and key programs of the Office of the Surgeon General (OTSG) during his official visit at Camp Aguinaldo on September 25.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2026-09-25T11:40:00+08:00","hits":18},{"id":1385,"title":"AFP Hosts COA Entrance Conference for 2026 Audit","slug":"afp-hosts-coa-entrance-conference-for-2026-audit","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"The Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) hosted the Commission on Audit (COA) for the 2026 COA Entrance Conference on September 17 here, marking the formal commencement of the annual audit engagement and reaffirming the AFP’s commitment to transparency, accountability, and sound financial management.","featured_image":"/media/library/2026/10/AFP_Hosts_COA_Entrance_Conference_for_2026_Audit1.jpg","image_caption":"AFP Chief of Staff General Antonio G. Nafarrete with AFP senior officers and personnel from GHQ, AFP, and members of the Commission on Audit (COA) team pose for a group photo during the 2026 Audit Engagement on September 17 in Camp Aguinaldo.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2026-09-21T11:32:00+08:00","hits":14},{"id":1384,"title":"AFP Advances CHR Leadership with First Civilian Director I","slug":"afp-advances-chr-leadership-with-first-civilian-director-i","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City -- The Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) formally welcomed Ms. Marites M. Sierra as the first Director I of the AFP Civilian Human Resources (CHR) during an oath-taking ceremony held here. The ceremony was presided over by Lieutenant General Edmundo G. Peralta PA, The Deputy Chief of Staff, AFP representing AFP Chief of Staff General Antonio G. Nafarrete PA.","featured_image":"/media/library/2026/09/AFP_Advances_CHR_Leadership_with_First_Civilian_Director_I.jpg","image_caption":"Ms. Marites M. Sierra takes her oath as the first Director I of the AFP Civilian Human Resources before Lieutenant General Edmundo G. Peralta PA, The Deputy Chief of Staff, AFP, during the oath-taking ceremony on September 15 at Camp Aguinaldo.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2026-09-15T16:00:00+08:00","hits":528},{"id":1383,"title":"AFP Strengthens Security Oversight for 2026 BARMM Parliamentary Elections","slug":"afp-strengthens-security-oversight-for-2026-barmm-parliamentary-elections","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City -- Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) Chief of Staff General Antonio G. Nafarrete, together with senior AFP officers, conducted continuous monitoring of the 2026 Bangsamoro Autonomous Region in Muslim Mindanao (BARMM) Parliamentary Elections at Camp Siongco in Barangay Awang, Datu Odin Sinsuat, Maguindanao del Norte, on September 15.","featured_image":"/media/library/2026/09/AFP_Strengthens_Security_Oversight_for_2026_BARMM_Parliamentary_Elections.jpg","image_caption":"⁨AFP Chief of Staff General Antonio G. Nafarrete emphasizes the AFP’s commitment to supporting a peaceful, secure, and credible 2026 Bangsamoro Autonomous Region in Muslim Mindanao (BARMM) Parliamentary Elections during a media engagement at Camp Siongco in Barangay Awang, Datu Odin Sinsuat, Maguindanao del Norte, on September 15.⁩⁩","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2026-09-15T13:54:00+08:00","hits":487},{"id":1382,"title":"AFP Salutes GHQ and HSC Commander’s Service, Welcomes New Leadership","slug":"afp-salutes-ghq-and-hsc-commanders-service-welcomes-new-leadership","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City -- The Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) honored Brigadier General Ricky A. Laniog PA for his decades of dedicated and exemplary service to the nation during a joint Retirement and Change of Command Ceremony of the General Headquarters and Headquarters Service Command (GHQ&HSC), on September 14, here.","featured_image":"/media/library/2026/09/AFP_Salutes_GHQ_and_HSC_Commanders_Service_Welcomes_New_Leadership.jpg","image_caption":"AFP Vice Chief of Staff Lieutenant General Rommel P. Roldan awards the Distinguished Service Medal to Brigadier General Ricky A. Laniog PA, outgoing Commander of the General Headquarters and Headquarters Service Command (GHQ&HSC) during the joint Retirement and Change of Command Ceremony, on September 14 at Camp Aguinaldo.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2026-09-15T13:53:00+08:00","hits":509},{"id":1381,"title":"AFP Chief checks election security efforts in Central Mindanao","slug":"afp-chief-checks-election-security-efforts-in-central-mindanao","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City -- General Antonio G. Nafarrete PA, Chief of Staff of the Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) visited two Army brigades in Central Mindanao on September 13 to check their election security preparations for the first Bangsamoro Parliamentary Election (BPE) 2026.","featured_image":"/media/library/2026/09/AFP_Chief_checks_election_security_efforts_in_Central_Mindanao.jpg","image_caption":"General Antonio G. Nafarrete PA, Chief of Staff, AFP addresses troops of the 1st Mechanized Infantry “Maaasahan” Brigade, Armor Division, Philippine Army, during his visit in Tacurong City, Sultan Kudarat on September 13, 2026. (Photo by: PFC Carmelotes PN(M)/PAOAFP)","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2026-09-15T13:51:00+08:00","hits":353},{"id":1380,"title":"AFP Sustains Vigilance for Peaceful BARMM Parliamentary Elections","slug":"afp-sustains-vigilance-for-peaceful-barmm-parliamentary-elections","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City -- Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) Chief of Staff General Antonio G. Nafarrete, together with senior AFP officers, conducted continuous election monitoring on September 14, as the 2026 Bangsamoro Autonomous Region in Muslim Mindanao (BARMM) Parliamentary Elections take place. The monitoring was conducted at Camp Siongco in Barangay Awang, Datu Odin Sinsuat, Maguindanao del Norte, as the AFP reinforced its commitment to supporting a peaceful, secure, and orderly electoral process.","featured_image":"/media/library/2026/09/AFP_Sustain_Vigilance_for_Peaceful_BARMM_Parliamentary_Elections.jpg","image_caption":"AFP Chief of Staff General Antonio G. Nafarrete discusses the latest security updates and operational measures during the 2026 BARMM Parliamentary Elections at Camp Siongco, Maguindanao del Norte, on September 14, 2026.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2026-09-15T13:49:00+08:00","hits":351},{"id":1379,"title":"AFP Honors Exemplary Service at 2026 Metrobank Foundation Awards","slug":"afp-honors-exemplary-service-at-2026-metrobank-foundation-awards","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City  -- The Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP), in partnership with the Metrobank Foundation and the Rotary Club of Makati, honored three exemplary military personnel during the 2026 Metrobank Foundation Outstanding Filipino Award for Soldiers (MFOFAS) ceremony held here today. The event was led by AFP Vice Chief of Staff Lieutenant General Rommel P. Roldan, representing AFP Chief of Staff General Antonio G. Nafarrete, who recognized the awardees for their outstanding contributions, dedication, and commitment to public service.","featured_image":"/media/library/2026/09/AFP_Honors_Exemplary_Service_at_2026_Metrobank_Foundation_Awards.jpg","image_caption":"AFP Vice Chief of Staff Lieutenant General Rommel P. Roldan, Major General Ramon P. Flores, AFP Deputy Chief of Staff for Personnel, J1, The AFP Sergeant Major, First Chief Master Sergeant (FCMS) Feliciano M Lazo, Mr. Philip Francisco U. Dy, President of the Metrobank Foundation, Inc., and Mr. Joseph Anthony M. Quesada, President of the Metrobank Foundation, Inc., gather with the 2026 MFOFAS awardees during the awarding ceremony on September 14, 2026, at Camp Aguinaldo.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2026-09-14T13:48:00+08:00","hits":338},{"id":1378,"title":"AFP, US Pacific Command, Canadian Armed Forces successfully conduct 20th MMCA in Sulu Sea","slug":"afp-us-pacific-command-canadian-armed-forces-successfully-conduct-20th-mmca-in-sulu-sea","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City  -- The Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP), United States Pacific Command (USPACOM), and Canadian Armed Forces (CAF) successfully conducted the 20th Multilateral Maritime Cooperative Activity (MMCA) from September 12 to 13, 2026, in the Sulu Sea.","featured_image":"/media/library/2026/09/AFP_US_Pacific_Command_Canadian_Armed_Forces_successfully_conduct_20th_MMCA_in_Sulu_Sea.jpg","image_caption":"BRP Suluan (MRRV-4406) and HMCS Regina (FFH 334) display coordination at sea with BRP Diego Silang (FFG7) during the Division Tactics/Officer of the Watch Maneuver Exercise for the 20th MMCA on 13 September 2026, in the Sulu Sea.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2026-09-14T13:45:00+08:00","hits":1272},{"id":1377,"title":"AFP Culminates 47th National Reservist Week, Underscores Reservists’ Critical Role in National Defense","slug":"afp-culminates-47th-national-reservist-week-underscores-reservists-critical-role-in-national-defense","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City -- The Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) culminated the 47th National Reservist Week on September 12, highlighting the critical role of reservists in strengthening national defense and supporting the Regular Force.","featured_image":"/media/library/2026/09/AFP_Culminates_47th_National_Reservist_Week_Underscores_Reservists_Critical_Role_in_National_Defense.jpg","image_caption":"Defense Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr. together with active AFP members and reservists as well as stakeholders come together in a show of unity during the culmination ceremony of the 47th National Reservist Week on September 12 in Camp Aguinaldo, Quezon City. (Photo by SSg Ambay PA/PAOAFP)","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2026-09-13T13:45:00+08:00","hits":342},{"id":1376,"title":"AFP Chief Checks Troop Readiness in BARMM visit","slug":"afp-chief-checks-troop-readiness-in-barmm-visit","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City -- Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) Chief of Staff General Antonio G. Nafarrete visited key military units in the Bangsamoro Autonomous Region of Muslim Mindanao (BARMM) on September 11 to assess their preparations for the 2026 Bangsamoro Parliamentary Election (BPE).","featured_image":"/media/library/2026/09/AFP_Chief_Checks_Troop_Readiness_in_BARMM_visit.jpg","image_caption":"General Antonio G Nafarrete PA, AFP Chief of Staff delivers his guidance to the members of the 101st Infantry Brigade, Philippine Army during his visit to Lanao del Sur on September 11, 2026. (Photo by PFC Carmelotes PN(M)/PAOAFP)","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2026-09-12T13:43:00+08:00","hits":233},{"id":1375,"title":"AFP Honors Retiring First-Ever Intelligence Command Chief, Welcomes New Commander","slug":"afp-honors-retiring-first-ever-intelligence-command-chief-welcomes-new-commander","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City -- The Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) honored Lieutenant General Ferdinand T. Barandon PA as he retired after nearly four decades of service and turned over leadership of the Intelligence Command, AFP during a ceremony in Camp Aguinaldo on September 10, 2026.","featured_image":"/media/library/2026/09/AFP_Honors_Retiring_First-Ever_Intelligence_Command_Chief_Welcomes_New_Commander.jpg","image_caption":"General Antonio G. Nafarrete PA, AFP Chief of Staff assisted by Mrs. Barandon, awards the Philippine Legion of Honor medal on Lieutenant General Ferdinand T. Barandon PA, during the Change of Command and Retirement Ceremony at Tejeros Hall, Camp Aguinaldo, Quezon City on September 10, 2026. (Photo by PFC Carmelotes PN(M)/PAOAFP)","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2026-09-10T13:42:00+08:00","hits":250},{"id":1374,"title":"AFP Chief Urges Airmen to Match Modern Capabilities with Professional Excellence","slug":"afp-chief-urges-airmen-to-match-modern-capabilities-with-professional-excellence","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City -- General Antonio G. Nafarrete, Chief of Staff of the Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP), underscored the importance of professional competence, technical proficiency, and operational readiness during his Talk to Troops at Headquarters Philippine Air Force at Colonel Jesus Villamor Air Base, Pasay City on September 7.","featured_image":"/media/library/2026/09/AFP_Chief_Urges_Airmen_to_Match_Modern_Capabilities_with_Professional_Excellence.jpg","image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2026-09-07T11:05:00+08:00","hits":388},{"id":1373,"title":"AFP Joins Nation in Advancing Maritime Consciousness During MANA Mo 2026","slug":"afp-joins-nation-in-advancing-maritime-consciousness-during-mana-mo-2026","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City -- The Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) joins the nation in observing the Maritime and Archipelagic Nation Awareness Month (MANA Mo) 2026 this September, under the theme “Karapatan sa Karagatan, Sama-sama Nating Alagaan.” The month-long observance underscores the Philippines’ identity and history as a maritime and archipelagic nation while promoting greater awareness of the country’s maritime interests, rights, and responsibilities.","featured_image":"/media/library/2026/09/AFP_Joins_Nation_in_Advancing_Maritime_Consciousness_During_MANA_Mo_2026.jpg","image_caption":"The Philippine flag is raised in recognition of the Maritime and Archipelagic Nation Awareness Month (MANA Mo) 2026, reaffirming the country’s identity as a maritime and archipelagic nation, on September 7 at Camp Aguinaldo.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2026-09-07T11:04:00+08:00","hits":1646},{"id":1372,"title":"AFP Drives Institutional Transformation, Enhances Personnel Welfare","slug":"afp-drives-institutional-transformation-enhances-personnel-welfare","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City -- The Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) reinforced its commitment to institutional transformation and personnel welfare during the simultaneous flag-raising ceremony held today, led by AFP Chief of Staff General Antonio G. Nafarrete. The ceremony highlighted key milestones under the AFP Transformation Roadmap and Institutionalization Pathway (AFPTRIP), alongside the formal turnover of gym equipment donated by Sportysole Incorporated.","featured_image":"/media/library/2026/09/AFP_Drives_Institutional_Transformation_Enhances_Personnel_Welfare.jpg","image_caption":"AFP Chief of Staff General Antonio G. Nafarrete, AFP Vice Chief of Staff Lieutenant General Rommel P. Roldan, and Deputy Chief of Staff, AFP Lieutenant General Edmundo G. Peralta, during the simultaneous flag-raising ceremony on September 7 at Camp Aguinaldo.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2026-09-07T11:03:00+08:00","hits":309},{"id":1371,"title":"AFP Sends Off Athletes, Coaches to Champion Excellence at 20th Asian Games","slug":"afp-sends-off-athletes-coaches-to-champion-excellence-at-20th-asian-games","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City -- General Antonio G. Nafarrete, Chief of Staff of the Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP), led the send-off ceremony for the soldier-athletes and soldier-coaches who will represent the Philippines at the 20th Asian Games. The ceremony underscored the AFP’s support for its athletes as they carry the country’s colors and uphold the honor of the Armed Forces on the international sporting stage.","featured_image":"/media/library/2026/09/AFP_Sends_Off_Athletes_Coaches_to_Champion_Excellence_at_20th_Asian_Games.jpg","image_caption":"AFP Chief of Staff General Antonio G. Nafarrete, AFP Vice Chief of Staff Lieutenant General Rommel P. Roldan, The Deputy Chief of Staff, AFP Lieutenant General Edmundo G. Peralta, and the soldier-athletes and soldier-coaches pose for a photo during the send-off ceremony on September 7 at Camp Aguinaldo.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2026-09-07T11:02:00+08:00","hits":219},{"id":1370,"title":"AFP Celebrates Civil Service, Highlights Civilian Expertise in National Defense","slug":"afp-celebrates-civil-service-highlights-civilian-expertise-in-national-defense","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City -- The Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) joined the nation in commemorating the 126th Philippine Civil Service Anniversary during a ceremony led by AFP Chief of Staff General Antonio G. Nafarrete today, here. The event recognized the vital contributions of civilian personnel whose expertise, professionalism, and commitment complement military capabilities in fulfilling the AFP’s constitutional mandate.","featured_image":"/media/library/2026/09/AFP_Celebrates_Civil_Service_Highlights_Civilian_Expertise_in_National_Defense.jpg","image_caption":"AFP Chief of Staff General Antonio G. Nafarrete, AFP Vice Chief of Staff Lieutenant General Rommel P. Roldan, The Deputy Chief of Staff, AFP Lieutenant General Edmundo G. Peralta, Ms. Marites M. Sierra, Acting Chief of the Civilian Personnel Administrative Division (CPAD), OJ1, and AFP civilian personnel pose for a photo during the commemoration of the 126th Philippine Civil Service Anniversary on September 7 at Camp Aguinaldo.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2026-09-07T11:01:00+08:00","hits":227},{"id":1369,"title":"AFP Salutes Military Nurses, Strengthens Commitment to Innovative Healthcare","slug":"afp-salutes-military-nurses-strengthens-commitment-to-innovative-healthcare","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City -- The Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) joined the celebration of the 88th Anniversary of the Nurse Corps, AFP and the 61st Anniversary of the Military Nurses Association of the Philippines, Inc. (MNAPI) on September 4, 2026, here, highlighting the enduring contributions of military nurses to the AFP and the nation. The joint celebration carried the theme, “Leadership and Innovation in Military Nursing: Serving the Nation, Shaping Global Health.”","featured_image":"/media/library/2026/09/AFP_Salutes_Military_Nurses_Strengthens_Commitment_to_Innovative_Healthcare.jpg","image_caption":"Lieutenant General Edmundo G. Peralta, Deputy Chief of Staff, AFP, joins Brigadier General Ma. Dolores M. Lim, Chief Nurse, AFP, and Brigadier General Venus M. Bajarin NC (Ret), President of the Military Nurses Association of the Philippines, Inc. (MNAPI), in presenting a plaque of recognition to honorees for their outstanding contributions and dedicated service to military nursing during the joint anniversary celebration of the 88th Anniversary of the Nurse Corps, AFP and the 61st Anniversary of the Military Nurses Association of the Philippines, Inc. (MNAPI) at Camp Aguinaldo on September 4, 2026.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2026-09-04T11:00:00+08:00","hits":223},{"id":1368,"title":"AFP, European Policy Delegates Strengthen Dialogue on Shared Security Interests","slug":"afp-european-policy-delegates-strengthen-dialogue-on-shared-security-interests","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City -- Lieutenant General Rommel P. Roldan, Vice Chief of Staff of the Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP), welcomed delegates from the European Values Center for Security Policy and Konrad Adenauer Stiftung Philippines during a courtesy visit on September 3, here.","featured_image":"/media/library/2026/09/AFP_EUROPEAN_POLICY_DELEGATES_STRENGTHEN_DIALOGUE_ON_SHARED_SECURITY_INTERESTS.jpg","image_caption":"AFP Vice Chief of Staff Lieutenant General Rommel P. Roldan, together with delegates led by Ms. Daniela Braun, Country Director of Konrad-Adenauer-Stiftung Philippines, and Mr. Jakub Janda, Executive Director of the European Values Center for Security Policy, pose for a photo during the courtesy visit at Camp Aguinaldo on September 3.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2026-09-03T10:59:00+08:00","hits":211},{"id":1366,"title":"AFP Leadership Honors Filipino Heroes, Affirms Continuing Duty to Country","slug":"afp-leadership-honors-filipino-heroes-affirms-continuing-duty-to-country","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City -- The Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) reaffirmed its enduring commitment to service, sacrifice, and patriotism as His Excellency President Ferdinand R. Marcos Jr., Commander-in-Chief, led the National Heroes’ Day commemoration at the Libingan ng mga Bayani in Taguig City on August 31.","featured_image":"/media/library/2026/09/AFP_LEADERSHIP_HONORS_FILIPINO_HEROES_AFFIRMS_CONTINUING_DUTY_TO_COUNTRY.jpg","image_caption":"AFP Vice Chief of Staff Lieutenant General Rommel P. Roldan PAF leads the arrival honors for His Excellency President Ferdinand R. Marcos Jr., Commander-in-Chief during the National Heroes’ Day commemoration at the Libingan ng mga Bayani in Taguig City on August 31.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2026-08-31T10:50:00+08:00","hits":236},{"id":1365,"title":"AFP Statement on the 75th Anniversary of the Philippines-United States Mutual Defense Treaty","slug":"afp-statement-on-the-75th-anniversary-of-the-philippines-united-states-mutual-defense-treaty","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"","featured_image":"/media/library/2026/09/AFP_STATEMENT_ON_THE_75TH_ANNIVERSARY_OF_THE_PHILIPPINES-UNITED_STATES_MUTUAL_DEFENSE_TREATY.jpg","image_caption":"AFP Statement on the 75th Anniversary of the Philippines-United States Mutual Defense Treaty","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2026-08-30T10:49:00+08:00","hits":180},{"id":1364,"title":"AFP deploys Disaster Response Units for Humanitarian Assistance and Disaster Response (HADR) Operations in Central Luzon","slug":"afp-deploys-disaster-response-units-for-humanitarian-assistance-and-disaster-response-hadr-operations-in-central-luzon","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"The Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) deployed personnel, vehicles, and other HADR assets to Tarlac, Pampanga, and Bataan to support local government units and disaster response agencies in addressing the severe effects of the Southwest Monsoon (Habagat) on August 29, 2026.","featured_image":"/media/library/2026/09/AFP_deploys_Disaster_Response_Units_for_Humanitarian_Assistance_and_Disaster_Response_HADR_Operations_in_Central_Luzon.jpg","image_caption":"The Northern Luzon Command in coordination with the Tarlac Provincial Disaster Risk Reduction Management Council on standby alert for Humantarian Assistance and Disaster Response operations to affected families and communities of the province.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2026-08-29T10:49:00+08:00","hits":205},{"id":1363,"title":"AFP Chief Calls on EASTMINCOM to Remain United, Steadfast in Safeguarding Eastern Mindanao","slug":"afp-chief-calls-on-eastmincom-to-remain-united-steadfast-in-safeguarding-eastern-mindanao","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City -- Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) Chief of Staff General Antonio G. Nafarrete PA called on the men and women of the Eastern Mindanao Command (EASTMINCOM) to remain steadfast in their sworn duty during the Command’s 20th Founding Anniversary celebration held at Naval Station Felix Apolinario, Panacan, Davao City, on August 28, 2026.","featured_image":"/media/library/2026/09/AFP_CHIEF_CALLS_ON_EASTMINCOM_TO_REMAIN_UNITED_STEADFAST_IN_SAFEGUARDING_EASTERN_MINDANAO.jpg","image_caption":"AFP Chief of Staff General Antonio G. Nafarrete PA with Lieutenant General Adonis Ariel G. Orio PA, EASTMINCOM Commander, presents a Plaque of Appreciation to Governor Nilo P. Demerey Jr. of the Province of Dinagat Islands in recognition of his exemplary leadership and valuable contributions to the mission of the Eastern Mindanao Command during its 20th Founding Anniversary celebration of EASTMINCOM held at Naval Station Felix Apolinario, Panacan, Davao City on August 28, 2026.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2026-08-28T10:48:00+08:00","hits":1429},{"id":1362,"title":"WESTMINCOM Marks 20 Years of Service, Strengthening Security in Western Mindanao","slug":"westmincom-marks-20-years-of-service-strengthening-security-in-western-mindanao","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City -- General Antonio G. Nafarrete PA, Chief of Staff of the Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP), joined the 20th Founding Anniversary celebration of the Western Mindanao Command (WESTMINCOM) during a ceremony held on August 27 at Camp General Basilio Navarro in Zamboanga City.","featured_image":"/media/library/2026/09/WESTMINCOM_MARKS_20_YEARS_OF_SERVICE_STRENGTHENING_SECURITY_IN_WESTERN_MINDANAO.jpg","image_caption":"AFP Chief of Staff General Antonio G. Nafarrete PA, Major General Jose Vladimir R. Cagara PA, WESTMINCOM Commander, together with AFP senior officers, enlisted personnel, civilian personnel, and stakeholders, pose for a group photo during the Command’s 20th Founding Anniversary celebration on August 27, 2026, at Camp General Basilio Navarro in Zamboanga City.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2026-08-27T10:47:00+08:00","hits":191},{"id":1361,"title":"AFP Affirms Full Support for Peaceful and Credible 2026 BARMM Parliamentary Elections","slug":"afp-affirms-full-support-for-peaceful-and-credible-2026-barmm-parliamentary-elections","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City -- General Antonio G. Nafarrete, Chief of Staff of the Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP), reaffirmed the military’s commitment to ensuring a peaceful and credible 2026 Bangsamoro Autonomous Region in Muslim Mindanao (BARMM) Parliamentary Elections during the Final Command Conference on August 26 at Camp Salipada K. Pendatun in Parang, Maguindanao del Norte.","featured_image":"/media/library/2026/09/AFP_AFFIRMS_FULL_SUPPORT_FOR_PEACEFUL_AND_CREDIBLE_2026_BARMM_PARLIAMENTARY_ELECTIONS.jpg","image_caption":"(From left) Lieutenant General Donald M. Gumiran, Commanding General of the Philippine Army; AFP Chief of Staff General Antonio G. Nafarrete; Police General Jose Melencio C. Nartatez Jr., Chief of the Philippine National Police; DILG Secretary Juanito Victor “Jonvic” Remulla; and COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia attend the Final Command Conference for the 2026 Bangsamoro Autonomous Region in Muslim Mindanao (BARMM) Parliamentary Elections on August 26 at Camp Salipada K. Pendatun in Parang, Maguindanao del Norte.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2026-08-26T10:46:00+08:00","hits":148},{"id":1359,"title":"Intelligence Command Marks 2nd Anniversary, Advances AFP’s Commitment to National Security","slug":"intelligence-command-marks-2nd-anniversary-advances-afps-commitment-to-national-security","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City -- The Intelligence Command, Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP), reaffirmed its commitment to advancing the AFP’s mission of protecting the nation and safeguarding national security as it marked its 2nd Founding Anniversary under the theme “One Command, One Purpose: Two Years of Excellence and Commitment,” during a ceremony held here today.","featured_image":"/media/library/2026/09/INTELLIGENCE_COMMAND_MARKS_2ND_ANNIVERSARY_ADVANCES_AFPS_COMMITMENT_TO_NATIONAL_SECURITY.jpg","image_caption":"AFP Chief of Staff General Antonio G. Nafarrete PA presents the AFP Transformation Roadmap Institutionalization Pathway (AFPTRIP) Compliant Status to the Intelligence Command, AFP, led by Lieutenant General Ferdinand T. Barandon PA, during the Command’s 2nd Founding Anniversary Ceremony on August 20 at Camp Aguinaldo.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2026-08-20T10:44:00+08:00","hits":140},{"id":1360,"title":"19th MMCA Successfully Strengthens Maritime Interoperability Among Philippines, US, and Australia","slug":"19th-mmca-successfully-strengthens-maritime-interoperability-among-philippines-us-and-australia","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City -- The Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP), together with the United States Pacific Command (USPACOM) and the Australian Defence Force (ADF), successfully concluded the 19th Multilateral Maritime Cooperative Activity (MMCA) in the West Philippine Sea from August 19 to 25, 2026.","featured_image":"/media/library/2026/09/19TH_MMCA_SUCCESSFULLY_STRENGTHENS_MARITIME_INTEROPERABILITY_AMONG_PHILIPPINES_US_AND_AUSTRALIA.jpg","image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2026-08-19T10:45:00+08:00","hits":1450},{"id":1358,"title":"AFP Statement on the Review of Policies on Reserve Force Recruitment, Promotions, and Awards","slug":"fp-statement-on-the-review-of-policies-on-reserve-force-recruitment-promotions-and-awards","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"","featured_image":"/media/library/2026/09/AFP_STATEMENT_ON_THE_REVIEW_OF_POLICIES_ON_RESERVE_FORCE_RECRUITMENT_PROMOTIONS_AND_AWARDS.jpg","image_caption":"AFP Statement on the Review of Policies on Reserve Force Recruitment, Promotions, and Awards","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2026-08-19T10:42:00+08:00","hits":131},{"id":1357,"title":"AFP Chief Visits Wounded Personnel, Honors Courage and Sacrifice","slug":"afp-chief-visits-wounded-personnel-honors-courage-and-sacrifice","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City -- The Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) honored the courage and sacrifice of its wounded personnel as AFP Chief of Staff General Antonio G. Nafarrete PA personally visited and awarded the Wounded Personnel Medal to troops undergoing treatment at the Western Mindanao Command (WESTMINCOM) Station Hospital in Camp General Basilio Navarro, Zamboanga City, on August 17, 2026.","featured_image":"/media/library/2026/09/AFP_CHIEF_VISITS_WOUNDED_PERSONNEL_HONORS_COURAGE_AND_SACRIFICE.jpg","image_caption":"AFP Chief of Staff General Antonio G. Nafarrete PA with Major General Jose Vladimir R. Cagara PA, WESTMINCOM Commander awards the Wounded Personnel Medal to Corporal Benjie C. Jacinto PA and Corporal Philip P. Wigan PA during his visit to wounded personnel at the Western Mindanao Command (WESTMINCOM) Station Hospital, Camp General Basilio Navarro, Zamboanga City, on August 17, 2026.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2026-08-17T10:41:00+08:00","hits":138},{"id":1356,"title":"Continuity in Command, Commitment to Peace: Cagara Takes Over WESTMINCOM","slug":"continuity-in-command-commitment-to-peace-cagara-takes-over-westmincom","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City -- The Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) welcomed Major General (MGen) Jose Vladimir R. Cagara PA as the Acting Commander of the Western Mindanao Command (WESTMINCOM) during a Change of Command Ceremony held on August 17 at Camp General Basilio Navarro, Zamboanga City. The ceremony was presided over by AFP Chief of Staff General Antonio G. Nafarrete PA.","featured_image":"/media/library/2026/09/CONTINUITY_IN_COMMAND_COMMITMENT_TO_PEACE_CAGARA_TAKES_OVER_WESTMINCOM.jpg","image_caption":"Lieutenant General Donald M. Gumiran PA, outgoing Commander, WESTMINCOM, formally welcomes Major General Jose Vladimir R. Cagara PA as the incoming Acting Commander of WESTMINCOM during the Change of Command Ceremony presided over by AFP Chief of Staff General Antonio G. Nafarrete on August 17, 2026, at Camp General Basilio Navarro, Zamboanga City.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2026-08-17T10:40:00+08:00","hits":142},{"id":1355,"title":"AFP Statement On the Strafing Incident Involving the Convoy of BARMM Interim Chief Minister Abdulraof Macacua","slug":"afp-statement-on-the-strafing-incident-involving-the-convoy-of-barmm-interim-chief-minister-abdulraof-macacua","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"","featured_image":"/media/library/2026/09/AFP_STATEMENT_ON_THE_STRAFING_INCIDENT_INVOLVING_THE_CONVOY_OF_BARMM_INTERIM_CHIEF_MINISTER_ABDULRAOF_MACACUA.jpg","image_caption":"AFP Statement On the Strafing Incident Involving the Convoy of BARMM Interim Chief Minister Abdulraof Macacua","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2026-08-16T10:39:00+08:00","hits":127},{"id":1354,"title":"AFP Chief Strengthens Navy Readiness, Coordination Through Leadership Engagement","slug":"afp-chief-strengthens-navy-readiness-coordination-through-leadership-engagement","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City -- General Antonio G. Nafarrete PA, Chief of Staff Armed Forces of the Philippines (CSAFP), reinforced the need for stronger coordination, readiness and interoperability during his visit to the Headquarters Philippine Navy at Naval Station Jose Andrada, Manila, on August 14, 2026.","featured_image":"/media/library/2026/09/AFP_CHIEF_STRENGTHENS_NAVY_READINESS_COORDINATION_THROUGH_LEADERSHIP_ENGAGEMENT.jpg","image_caption":"General Antonio G. Nafarrete PA Chief of Staff, AFP engages with Vice Admiral Jose Ma Ambrosio Q. Ezpeleta's leadership during his official visit to Headquarters Philippine Navy at Naval Station Jose Andrada, Manila on August 14, 2026. (Photo by SSg Ambay PA/PAOAFP)","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2026-08-14T10:38:00+08:00","hits":1399},{"id":1353,"title":"Special Operations Command Marks 23rd Anniversary, Honors Excellence and Commitment to Mission","slug":"special-operations-command-marks-23rd-anniversary-honors-excellence-and-commitment-to-mission","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City -- General Antonio G. Nafarrete PA, Chief of Staff of the Armed Forces of the Philippines (CSAFP), led the celebration of the 23rd Founding Anniversary of the Special Operations Command, AFP during a ceremony held here today, August 14.","featured_image":"/media/library/2026/09/SPECIAL_OPERATIONS_COMMAND_MARKS_23RD_ANNIVERSARY_HONORS_EXCELLENCE_AND_COMMITMENT_TO_MISSION.jpg","image_caption":"AFP Chief of Staff General Antonio G. Nafarrete PA, Major General Rosendo C. Abad Jr., Commander of SOC, AFP, and members of the Joint Special Operations Command pose for a group photo during their 23rd Founding Anniversary ceremony on August 14.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2026-08-14T10:37:00+08:00","hits":82},{"id":1352,"title":"AFP Reinforces Leadership Stability with Confirmation of 38 Senior Officers","slug":"afp-reinforces-leadership-stability-with-confirmation-of-38-senior-officers","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City -- The Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) further strengthened leadership stability and joint force readiness following the Commission on Appointments’ confirmation of the ad interim appointments of 38 senior officers on August 13 in Pasay City.","featured_image":"/media/library/2026/09/AFP_REINFORCES_LEADERSHIP_STABILITY_WITH_CONFIRMATION_OF_38_SENIOR_OFFICERS.jpg","image_caption":"General Antonio G. Nafarrete PA, Chief of Staff, AFP, leads the promoted senior military officers during the plenary session of the Commission on Appointments on August 13.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2026-08-13T10:36:00+08:00","hits":94},{"id":1351,"title":"AFP Honors LtGen Reyeg in Retirement Ceremony; Installs New Acting VISCOM Commander","slug":"afp-honors-ltgen-reyeg-in-retirement-ceremony-installs-new-acting-viscom-commander","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City  -- The Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) paid tribute to the distinguished military career of Lieutenant General Fernando M. Reyeg PA during a Retirement Ceremony, followed by the Change of Command of the Visayas Command (VISCOM), held today at Camp Lapu-Lapu, Cebu City.","featured_image":"/media/library/2026/09/AFP_HONORS_LTGEN_REYEG_IN_RETIREMENT_CEREMONY_INSTALLS_NEW_ACTING_VISCOM_COMMANDER.jpg","image_caption":"AFP Chief of Staff General Antonio G. Nafarrete PA meets with VISCOM officers upon his arrival at Camp Lapu-Lapu, Cebu City, on August 12.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2026-08-12T10:35:00+08:00","hits":91},{"id":1350,"title":"New Army Chief takes command, reinforces AFP’s defense readiness","slug":"new-army-chief-takes-command-reinforces-afps-defense-readiness","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City -- Lieutenant General Donald M. Gumiran PA formally assumed command of the Philippine Army from General Antonio G. Nafarrete PA during the 68th Philippine Army Change of Command Ceremony at Fort Bonifacio, Taguig City on August 11, 2026.","featured_image":"/media/library/2026/09/NEW_ARMY_CHIEF_TAKES_COMMAND_REINFORCES_AFPS_DEFENSE_READINESS.jpg","image_caption":"Lieutenant General Donald M. Gumiran, the new Philippine Army Commanding General, presents a memento to His Excellency President Ferdinand R. Marcos Jr., Commander-in-Chief of the AFP, as Guest of Honor and Speaker during the 68th Philippine Army Change of Command Ceremony at Fort Bonifacio, Taguig City on August 11, 2026.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2026-08-11T10:34:00+08:00","hits":127},{"id":1349,"title":"AFP activates HADR Teams in response to weather-related incidents","slug":"afp-activates-hadr-teams-in-response-to-weather-related-incidents","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City -- The Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) has activated and placed its Humanitarian Assistance and Disaster Response (HADR) assets on standby in response to the prevailing southwest monsoon and tropical cyclone-related weather disturbances on August 9, 2026.","featured_image":"/media/library/2026/09/AFP_ACTIVATES_HADR_TEAMS_IN_RESPONSE_TO_WEATHER-RELATED_INCIDENTS.jpg","image_caption":"Two (2) Search, Rescue, and Retrieval (SRR) Teams from the 33rd Mechanized Company, 3rd Mechanized Battalion, Armor Division, Philippine Army placed on standby alert on August 9, 2026.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2026-08-09T10:33:00+08:00","hits":82},{"id":1348,"title":"AFP, USPACOM Strengthen Alliance, Endorse 2027 Defense Engagements","slug":"afp-uspacom-strengthen-alliance-endorse-2027-defense-engagements","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City -- General Antonio G. Nafarrete PA, Chief of Staff of the Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP), and Admiral Samuel John Paparo Jr., Commander of the United States Pacific Command (USPACOM), reaffirmed the enduring Philippine-U.S. defense partnership during the Mutual Defense Board–Security Engagement Board (MDB-SEB) meeting held on August 7, here.","featured_image":"/media/library/2026/09/AFP_USPACOM_STRENGTHEN_ALLIANCE_ENDORSE_2027_DEFENSE_ENGAGEMENTS.jpg","image_caption":"AFP Chief of Staff General Antonio G. Nafarrete PA and Admiral Samuel John Paparo Jr., USPACOM Commander, present the signed 2027 Mutual Defense Board–Security Engagement Board (MDB-SEB) Plan of Activities, reaffirming the enduring alliance and shared commitment of the Philippines and the United States to regional peace, stability, and mutual defense.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2026-08-07T10:32:00+08:00","hits":61},{"id":1347,"title":"AFP Ensures Continuity in Leadership, Honors Outgoing AJ10","slug":"afp-ensures-continuity-in-leadership-honors-outgoing-aj10","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City -- The Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) marked the turnover of the Assistant Deputy Chief of Staff for Financial Management, AJ10, and the retirement ceremony of Commodore Alex V. Gianan, Philippine Navy (PN) at Tejeros Hall, AFPCOC on August 7, 2026.","featured_image":"/media/library/2026/09/AFP_ENSURES_CONTINUITY_IN_LEADERSHIP_HONORS_OUTGOING_AJ10.jpg","image_caption":"Lieutenant General Edmundo G. Peralta, Deputy Chief of Staff, AFP presents an encased Philippine flag to Commodore Alex V. Gianan during the Turnover and Retirement Ceremony held in Camp Aguinaldo, Quezon City on August 7, 2026.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2026-08-07T10:31:00+08:00","hits":420},{"id":1346,"title":"AFP Strengthens Leadership Through J8 Change of Office Ceremony","slug":"afp-strengthens-leadership-through-j8-change-of-office-ceremony","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City -- The Armed Forces of the Philippines formally conducted the Change of Chief of Office Ceremony for the Deputy Chief of Staff for Education and Training, J8, at the Firing Range Function Hall on August 4.","featured_image":"/media/library/2026/09/AFP_STRENGTHENS_LEADERSHIP_THROUGH_J8_CHANGE_OF_OFFICE_CEREMONY.jpg","image_caption":"Lieutenant General Edmundo G. Peralta PA, Deputy Chief of Staff AFP, presents the Distinguished Service Medal Award to Major General Arsenio DC Sadural PA the outgoing Deputy Chief of Staff for Education and Training, J8, assisted by the outgoing chief's spouse during the Change of Chief of Office Ceremony held at the Firing Range Function Hall, Camp General Emilio Aguinaldo, Quezon City on August 4.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2026-08-04T10:30:00+08:00","hits":30},{"id":1367,"title":"General Antonio G. Nafarrete PA, Chief of Staff of the Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP), paid his respects to Major Ma. Joshua P. Santiago","slug":"general-antonio-g-nafarrete-pa-chief-of-staff-of-the-armed-forces-of-the-philippines-afp-paid-his-respects-to-major-ma-joshua-p-santiago","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"General Antonio G. Nafarrete PA, Chief of Staff of the Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP), paid his respects to Major Ma. Joshua P. Santiago, who served as Aide-de-Camp to the Commander-in-Chief, President Ferdinand R. Marcos Jr., during a visit to his wake on August 28, 2026, at the Libingan ng mga Bayani in Taguig City.","featured_image":"/media/library/2026/09/CSAFP_PAID_HIS_RESPECTS_TO_MAJOR_MA._JOSHUA_P._SANTIAGO.jpg","image_caption":"General Antonio G. Nafarrete PA, Chief of Staff of the Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP), paid his respects to Major Ma. Joshua P. Santiago, who served as Aide-de-Camp to the Commander-in-Chief, President Ferdinand R. Marcos Jr., during a visit to his wake on August 28, 2026, at the Libingan ng mga Bayani in Taguig City.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2026-08-03T10:58:00+08:00","hits":52},{"id":1344,"title":"AFP Dental Service turns over prize money to EBSO to support educational benefits","slug":"afp-dental-service-turns-over-prize-money-to-ebso-to-support-educational-benefits","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City -- The Armed Forces of the Philippines Dental Service (AFPDS) formally turned over its award prize to the Educational Benefit System Office, AFP (EBSO, AFP) during the AFP Flag Raising Ceremony at the General Headquarters Canopy on August 3, 2026.","featured_image":"/media/library/2026/09/AFP_DENTAL_SERVICE_TURNS_OVER_PRIZE_MONEY_TO_EBSO_TO_SUPPORT_EDUCATIONAL_BENEFITS.jpg","image_caption":"General Antonio G. Nafarrete PA, Chief of Staff, AFP, leads the ceremonial turnover of the AFP Dental Service's PhP100,000 award prize to the Educational Benefit System Office, AFP, during the AFP Dental Service prize money turnover to EBSO, AFP on August 3 at General Headquarters, Camp Aguinaldo. Photo by Cpl Luna PA/PAOAFP","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2026-08-03T10:27:00+08:00","hits":23},{"id":1343,"title":"AFP commemorates 77th International Humanitarian Law Month in new Chief's first flag-raising","slug":"afp-commemorates-77th-international-humanitarian-law-month-in-new-chiefs-first-flag-raising","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City -- The Chief of Staff of the Armed Forces of the Philippines (CSAFP), General Antonio G. Nafarrete PA, led the observance of the 77th International Humanitarian Law (IHL) Month and the IHL Commitment Oath-Taking Ceremony during his first flag-raising ceremony as the new CSAFP at the General Headquarters Canopy on August 3, 2026.","featured_image":"/media/library/2026/09/AFP_COMMEMORATES_77TH_INTERNATIONAL_HUMANITARIAN_LAW_MONTH_IN_NEW_CHIEFS_FIRST_FLAG-RAISING.jpg","image_caption":"The Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) Officers, enlisted personnel, and civilian human resources raise their right hands as they pledge their reaffirmation of commitment and support for IHL during the Commemoration of the 77th International Humanitarian Law (IHL) Month Flag Raising and IHL Commitment Oath-Taking Ceremony on 3 August at General Headquarters, Camp Aguinaldo. Photo by PFC Carmelotes PN(M)/PAOAFP","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2026-08-03T10:26:00+08:00","hits":21},{"id":1342,"title":"AFP Chief Receives JUSMAG-Philippines Chief","slug":"afp-chief-receives-jusmag-philippines-chief","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City -- General Antonio G. Nafarrete PA, Chief of Staff of the Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) welcomed Colonel Daniel Oh, Chief of the Joint United States Military Assistance Group (JUSMAG)-Philippines, during a courtesy call at the General Headquarters on August 3, 2026.","featured_image":"/media/library/2026/09/AFP_CHIEF_RECEIVES_JUSMAG-PHILIPPINES_CHIEF.jpg","image_caption":"General Antonio G. Nafarrete, AFP Chief of Staff hands over a token to Colonel Daniel Oh during a courtesy call in Camp Aguinaldo, Quezon City on August 3, 2026.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2026-08-03T10:25:00+08:00","hits":24},{"id":1345,"title":"AFP Honors Capt Venus Gualdaquever's dedicated service in Retirement Ceremony","slug":"afp-honors-capt-venus-gualdaquevers-dedicated-service-in-retirement-ceremony","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City -- The Armed Forces of the Philippines honored the distinguished military service of Captain Venus G. Gualdaquever PN during her retirement ceremony held at Tejeros Hall, AFP Commissioned Officers Country Club on July 31.","featured_image":"/media/library/2026/09/AFP_HONORS_CAPT_VENUS_GUALDAQUEVERS_DEDICATED_SERVICE_IN_RETIREMENT_CEREMONY.jpg","image_caption":"Commodore Ramilo B. Trinidad PN, Assistant Deputy Chief of Staff for Personnel, AJ1 presents the award to Captain Gualdaquever in recognition of her years of faithful and selfless service during the Retirement Ceremony at Tejeros Hall, Camp General Emilio Aguinaldo on July 31.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2026-07-31T10:28:00+08:00","hits":16},{"id":1341,"title":"AFP Joins Feast of St. Ignatius, Marks 40th Military Ordinariate Anniversary","slug":"afp-joins-feast-of-st-ignatius-marks-40th-military-ordinariate-anniversary","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City -- The Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) joined the celebration of the Feast of Saint Ignatius of Loyola and the 40th Founding Anniversary of the Military Ordinariate of the Philippines (MOP) held today, here. The celebration was graced by the Apostolic Nuncio to the Philippines, Most Reverend Charles John Brown, D.D.","featured_image":"/media/library/2026/09/AFP_JOINS_FEAST_OF_ST._IGNATIUS_MARKS_40TH_MILITARY_ORDINARIATE_ANNIVERSARY.jpg","image_caption":"Most Reverend Charles John Brown, D.D., Apostolic Nuncio to the Philippines, joins AFP Chief of Staff General Antonio G. Nafarrete PA, and AFP senior officers for a commemorative photo following the Mass of the 40th Founding Anniversary of the Military Ordinariate of the Philippines (MOP) on July 31 at Camp Aguinaldo.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2026-07-31T10:17:00+08:00","hits":19},{"id":1340,"title":"AFP Chief presides over Donning of Ranks for Newly Promoted Generals","slug":"afp-chief-presides-over-donning-of-ranks-for-newly-promoted-generals","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City -- General Antonio G. Nafarrete PA, Chief of Staff of the Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) presided over the Donning of Ranks Ceremony for eight newly promoted Generals on July 30, 2026 at Silid Lapulapu, General Headquarters Building, Camp General Emilio Aguinaldo.","featured_image":"/media/library/2026/09/AFP_CHIEF_PRESIDES_OVER_DONNING_OF_RANKS_FOR_NEWLY_PROMOTED_GENERALS.jpg","image_caption":"AFP Chief of Staff General Antonio G. Nafarrete PA with the newly promoted officers, and AFP senior officers gather for a photo during the Donning of Ranks Ceremony on July 30 in Camp Aguinaldo.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2026-07-30T10:16:00+08:00","hits":42},{"id":1339,"title":"AFP, US, Japan conclude 17th Multilateral Maritime Cooperative Activity","slug":"afp-us-japan-conclude-17th-multilateral-maritime-cooperative-activity","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City -- The Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP), together with the United States Pacific Command (USPACOM) and the Japan Maritime Self-Defense Force (JMSDF), successfully conducted the 17th Multilateral Maritime Cooperative Activity (MMCA) in the West Philippine Sea from July 21 to 25, 2026.","featured_image":"/media/library/2026/09/AFP_US_JAPAN_CONCLUDE_17TH_MULTILATERAL_MARITIME_COOPERATIVE_ACTIVITY.jpg","image_caption":"Philippine Navy personnel aboard BRP Antonio Luna (FFG15) render honors alongside their Japanese counterparts, demonstrating professionalism and mutual respect among partner forces during the 17th Multilateral Maritime Cooperative Activity in the West Philippine Sea.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2026-07-26T10:15:00+08:00","hits":75},{"id":1337,"title":"AFP Chief Visits Pag-Asa Island, Commends Troops of Joint Task Unit Pag-Asa","slug":"afp-chief-visits-pag-asa-island-commends-troops-of-joint-task-unit-pag-asa","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City -- Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) Chief of Staff General Antonio G. Nafarrete PA visited Pag-Asa Island on July 25, 2026 where he met with the personnel of Joint Task Unit Pag-asa and personally recognized outstanding military personnel.","featured_image":"/media/library/2026/09/AFP_CHIEF_VISITS_PAG-ASA_ISLAND_COMMENDS_TROOPS_OF_JOINT_TASK_UNIT_PAG-ASA.jpg","image_caption":"AFP Chief of Staff General Antonio G. Nafarrete PA, together with Philippine Navy Flag Officer in Command Vice Admiral Jose Ma. Ambrosio Q. Ezpeleta PN, Philippine Air Force Commanding General Lieutenant General Arthur M. Cordura PAF, and Commander, Western Command Vice Admiral Alan M. Javier PN stand with members of the AFP leadership at the Pag-Asa Island Marker during their visit on July 25, 2026.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2026-07-25T10:12:00+08:00","hits":40},{"id":1336,"title":"Strengthening the Foundation of Army Excellence Through New Leadership","slug":"strengthening-the-foundation-of-army-excellence-through-new-leadership","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City -- General Antonio G Nafarrete, Chief of Staff of the Armed Forces of the Philippines (CSAFP) formally welcomed Brigadier General Lennon G Babilonia as the Acting Commander of the Education and Training Command, Philippine Army as Lieutenant General Michael G Logico officially relinquished his post during a Change of Command Ceremony held today at Camp O'Donnell in Capas, Tarlac.","featured_image":"/media/library/2026/09/STRENGTHENING_THE_FOUNDATION_OF_ARMY_EXCELLENCE_THROUGH_NEW_LEADERSHIP.jpg","image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2026-07-24T10:12:00+08:00","hits":24},{"id":1335,"title":"AFP Welcomes New PMA Superintendent in Leadership Transition","slug":"afp-welcomes-new-pma-superintendent-in-leadership-transition","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City -- General Antonio G. Nafarrete PA, Chief of Staff of the Armed Forces of the Philippines (CSAFP) presided over the Philippine Military Academy (PMA) Change of Command and Retirement Ceremony at Fort General Gregorio H. del Pilar, Baguio City on July 22.","featured_image":"/media/library/2026/09/AFP_WELCOMES_NEW_PMA_SUPERINTENDENT_IN_LEADERSHIP_TRANSITION.jpg","image_caption":"The Chief of Staff AFP, General Antonio G Nafarrete PA, presides over the turnover of Command Symbol to Lieutenant General Michael G Logico PA at Fort General Gregorio H. del Pilar, Baguio City on 22 July. (Photo by Cpl Lazano PA, OACPA)","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2026-07-22T10:10:00+08:00","hits":31},{"id":1333,"title":"President Marcos Leads AFP Change of Command, Honors General Brawner's Landmark Leadership","slug":"president-marcos-leads-afp-change-of-command-honors-general-brawners-landmark-leadership","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City -- The Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) led by Commander-in-Chief, President Ferdinand R. Marcos Jr., presided over the Change of Command and Retirement Ceremony, formally marking the conclusion of the tenure of General Romeo S. Brawner Jr. as 60th Chief of Staff, AFP, and the assumption of command by General Antonio G Nafarrete.","featured_image":"/media/library/2026/09/PRESIDENT_MARCOS_LEADS_AFP_CHANGE_OF_COMMAND_HONORS_GENERAL_BRAWNERS_LANDMARK_LEADERSHIP.jpg","image_caption":"His Excellency President Ferdinand R. Marcos Jr., Commander-in-Chief of the Armed Forces of the Philippines presents the encased Philippine Flag to the outgoing CSAFP General Romeo S. Brawner Jr. PA, assisted by Hon. Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr. Secretary National Defense alongside Mrs. Melody Mariele Brawner as a symbol of the nation's gratitude for his faithful, honorable, and dedicated service to the Filipino people at Camp General Emilio Aguinaldo, Quezon City on 21 July.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2026-07-22T10:08:00+08:00","hits":54},{"id":1332,"title":"AFP Statement on the Successful Medical Evacuation Mission in Ayungin Shoal","slug":"afp-statement-on-the-successful-medical-evacuation-mission-in-ayungin-shoal","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"","featured_image":"/media/library/2026/09/AFP_STATEMENT_ON_THE_SUCCESSFUL_MEDICAL_EVACUATION_MISSION_IN_AYUNGIN_SHOAL.jpg","image_caption":"AFP Statement on the Successful Medical Evacuation Mission in Ayungin Shoal","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2026-07-22T10:07:00+08:00","hits":73},{"id":1334,"title":"General Nafarrete Takes the Helm as the 61st Chief of Staff AFP","slug":"general-nafarrete-takes-the-helm-as-the-61st-chief-of-staff-afp","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City -- General Antonio G. Nafarrete PA formally assumed as the 61st Chief of Staff of the Armed Forces of the Philippines (CSAFP) during a Change of Command and Retirement Ceremony in honor of the outgoing Chief of Staff General Romeo S Brawner Jr., presided over by Commander-in-Chief, His Excellency President Ferdinand R. Marcos Jr. on July 21, here. He succeeds the outgoing AFP Chief of Staff following a distinguished career marked by strategic leadership.","featured_image":"/media/library/2026/09/GENERAL_NAFARRETE_TAKES_THE_HELM_AS_THE_61ST_CHIEF_OF_STAFF_AFP.jpg","image_caption":"His Excellency President Ferdinand R. Marcos Jr., Commander-in-Chief of the Armed Forces of the Philippines, hands over the Command Symbol to General Antonio G Nafarrete, PA symbolizing the transfer of leadership from General Romeo S Brawner Jr. during the Change of Command and Retirement Ceremony at Camp General Emilio Aguinaldo, Quezon City on 21 July.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2026-07-21T10:09:00+08:00","hits":71},{"id":1331,"title":"AFP Statement on Misleading claims on China Coast Guard's latest Aggressive Actions in Ayungin Shoal","slug":"afp-statement-on-misleading-claims-on-china-coast-guards-latest-aggressive-actions-in-ayungin-shoal-2","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"","featured_image":"/media/library/2026/09/AFP_STATEMENT_ON_MISLEADING_CLAIMS_ON_CHINA_COAST_GUARDS_LATEST_AGGRESSIVE_ACTIONS_IN_AYUNGIN_SHOAL.jpg","image_caption":"AFP Statement on Misleading claims on China Coast Guard's latest Aggressive Actions in Ayungin Shoal","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2026-07-21T10:06:00+08:00","hits":83},{"id":1330,"title":"AFP Statement on Misleading claims on China Coast Guard's latest Aggressive Actions in Ayungin Shoal","slug":"afp-statement-on-misleading-claims-on-china-coast-guards-latest-aggressive-actions-in-ayungin-shoal","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"","featured_image":"/media/library/2026/09/AFP_STATEMENT_ON_MISLEADING_CLAIMS_ON_CHINA_COAST_GUARDS_LATEST_AGGRESSIVE_ACTIONS_IN_AYUNGIN_SHOAL.jpg","image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2026-07-21T10:06:00+08:00","hits":75},{"id":1329,"title":"Preserving Valor, Inspiring Generations: AFP Opens Museum at Camp Aguinaldo","slug":"preserving-valor-inspiring-generations-afp-opens-museum-at-camp-aguinaldo","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City -- The Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP), through the Education and Training Command (ETCAFP), formally inaugurated the AFP Museum in a ceremony held today at Camp Aguinaldo, reaffirming its commitment to preserving the institution's rich military heritage and honoring the sacrifices of Filipino soldiers.","featured_image":"/media/library/2026/09/PRESERVING_VALOR_INSPIRING_GENERATIONS_AFP_OPENS_MUSEUM_AT_CAMP_AGUINALDO.jpg","image_caption":"AFP Chief of Staff General Romeo S Brawner Jr., accompanied by Major General Oliver C Maquiling, Commander of the Education and Training Command, AFP views the Battle of Yultong exhibit, highlighting the bravery and sacrifice of Filipino soldiers during the opening ceremony of the AFP Museum at Camp Aguinaldo on July 16.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2026-07-16T10:05:00+08:00","hits":33},{"id":1328,"title":"AFP Chief Highlights Unity and Readiness During NCRCOM Visit","slug":"afp-chief-highlights-unity-and-readiness-during-ncrcom-visit","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City -- As part of his farewell visits to major Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) units ahead of his retirement, AFP Chief of Staff General Romeo S Brawner Jr. visited the National Capital Region Command (NCRCOM) on July 15 to reaffirm the organization's commitment to operational excellence, unity, and mission readiness.","featured_image":"/media/library/2026/09/AFP_CHIEF_HIGHLIGHTS_UNITY_AND_READINESS_DURING_NCRCOM_VISIT.jpg","image_caption":"AFP Chief of Staff General Romeo S Brawner Jr. meets with NCRCOM Officers and personnel during his visit to Headquarters NCRCOM in Camp Aguinaldo on July 15.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2026-07-15T10:04:00+08:00","hits":44},{"id":1327,"title":"AFP, BOC Enhance Inter-Agency Coordination Against Smuggling and Illicit Trade","slug":"afp-boc-enhance-inter-agency-coordination-against-smuggling-and-illicit-trade","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City -- The Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) and the Bureau of Customs (BOC) signed a Memorandum of Understanding (MOU) today to strengthen inter-agency cooperation in support of national security and border protection. AFP Chief of Staff General Romeo S Brawner Jr. and BOC Commissioner Ariel F. Nepomuceno led the signing ceremony held on July 15 here.","featured_image":"/media/library/2026/09/AFP_BOC_ENHANCE_INTER-AGENCY_COORDINATION_AGAINST_SMUGGLING_AND_ILLICIT_TRADE.jpg","image_caption":"AFP Chief of Staff General Romeo S Brawner Jr. and BOC Commissioner Ariel F. Nepomuceno seal the new partnership with a firm handshake following the ceremonial signing of the MOU on July 15 at Camp Aguinaldo.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2026-07-15T10:03:00+08:00","hits":19},{"id":1326,"title":"AFP Hosts Vietnam Defense Delegation for Women, Peace and Security Study Visit","slug":"afp-hosts-vietnam-defense-delegation-for-women-peace-and-security-study-visit","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City -- The Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP), through its Gender and Development (GAD) Office, welcomed a delegation from the Vietnam Ministry of National Defense (VIETMOND), together with representatives from UN Women Vietnam and UN Women Philippines, on July 14, 2026, as part of their study visit to the Philippines from July 13 to 17.","featured_image":"/media/library/2026/09/AFP_HOSTS_VIETNAM_DEFENSE_DELAGATE_FOR_WOMEN_PEACE_AND_SECURITY_STUDY_VISIT.jpg","image_caption":"Captain Venus G Gualdaquever PN (GSC), Chief of the AFP Gender and Development Office, joins Colonel Nguyễn Thị Lan Hương of the Vietnam Ministry of National Defense, VIETMOND delegates, and AFP GAD personnel in a group photo during the study visit on July 14 at Camp Aguinaldo.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2026-07-15T10:02:00+08:00","hits":46},{"id":1325,"title":"AFP Chaplain Service Welcomes New Leadership, Honors Legacy of Dedicated Service","slug":"afp-chaplain-service-welcomes-new-leadership-honors-legacy-of-dedicated-service","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City -- The Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) held the Change of Chief of Office and Retirement Ceremony of the Chief Chaplain Service on July 15, honoring Brigadier General Daniel B Tansip for his decades of dedicated service and formally installing Colonel Roy L Onggao as the new Chief Chaplain Service today, here.","featured_image":"/media/library/2026/09/AFP_CHAPLAIN_SERVICE_WELCOMES_NEW_LEADERSHIP_HONORS_LEGACY_OF_DEDICATED_SERVICE.jpg","image_caption":"AFP Chief of Staff General Romeo S Brawner Jr. presents the gallery of medals to Brigadier General Daniel B Tansip in recognition of his outstanding service and dedication to the AFP during the Change of Chief of Office and Retirement Ceremony at Camp Aguinaldo on July 15.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2026-07-15T10:01:00+08:00","hits":22},{"id":1324,"title":"A Tribute to Service and Leadership: General Brawner Receives Military Honors","slug":"a-tribute-to-service-and-leadership-general-brawner-receives-military-honors","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City -- Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) Chief of Staff General Romeo S Brawner Jr. received a Testimonial Parade and Review from the Philippine Army during a ceremony held on July 14, 2026, at the Headquarters Philippine Army, Fort Bonifacio, Taguig City, in recognition of his exemplary leadership and distinguished military service.","featured_image":"/media/library/2026/09/A_TRIBUTE_TO_SERVICE_AND_LEADERSHIP_GENERAL_BRAWNER_RECEIVES_MILITARY_HONORS.jpg","image_caption":"AFP Chief of Staff General Romeo S Brawner Jr. salutes the marching troops of the Philippine Army during the Testimonial Parade and Review held on July 14, 2026, at the Headquarters Philippine Army, Fort Bonifacio, Taguig City.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2026-07-14T10:00:00+08:00","hits":27},{"id":1323,"title":"AFP Chief of Staff Inaugurates New CMO Hall to Strengthen Community Partnerships","slug":"afp-chief-of-staff-inaugurates-new-cmo-hall-to-strengthen-community-partnerships","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City -- Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) Chief of Staff General Romeo S Brawner Jr. led the blessing and inauguration of the new Kaamulan Convergence Hall of the Civil-Military Operations Regiment (CMOR) during a ceremony held on July 14, 2026, at Fort Andres Bonifacio, Taguig City.","featured_image":"/media/library/2026/09/AFP_CHIEF_OF_STAFF_INAUGURATES_NEW_CMO_HALL_TO_STRENGTHEN_COMMUNITY_PARTNERSHIPS.jpg","image_caption":"AFP Chief of Staff General Romeo S Brawner Jr. meets with the officers and personnel of the Civil-Military Operations Regiment (CMOR), Philippine Army, ahead of the Kaamulan Convergence Hall Inauguration Ceremony on July 14, 2026, at Fort Andres Bonifacio, Taguig City.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2026-07-14T09:59:00+08:00","hits":13},{"id":1322,"title":"AFP Chief Receives SOC Beret, Honors Commitment of Special Operations Forces","slug":"afp-chief-receives-soc-beret-honors-commitment-of-special-operations-forces","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City -- The Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) Joint Special Operations Command (JSOC) bestowed the SOC Beret and Flash Badge on AFP Chief of Staff General Romeo S Brawner Jr., during a ceremony held today here, in recognition of his solidarity with the elite forces committed to conducting specialized missions in defense of the nation.","featured_image":"/media/library/2026/09/AFP_CHIEF_RECEIVES_SOC_BERET_HONORS_COMMITMENT_OF_SPECIAL_OPERATIONS_FORCES.jpg","image_caption":"Major General Rosendo C Abad Jr., Commander of the Joint Special Operations Command (JSOC), bestows the Special Operations Command Beret on AFP Chief of Staff General Romeo S Brawner Jr. during the SOC Beret and Flash Badge Donning Ceremony on July 13 at Camp Aguinaldo.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2026-07-13T09:58:00+08:00","hits":24},{"id":1321,"title":"AFP Statement on the 10th Anniversary of the 2016 Arbitral Award","slug":"afp-statement-on-the-10th-anniversary-of-the-2016-arbitral-award","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"","featured_image":"/media/library/2026/09/AFP_STATEMENT_ON_THE_10TH_ANNIVERSARY_OF_THE_2016_ARBITRAL_AWARD.jpg","image_caption":"READ: AFP Statement on the 10th Anniversary of the 2016 Arbitral Award","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2026-07-12T09:57:00+08:00","hits":66},{"id":1320,"title":"AFP joins National Peace Walk, reaffirms commitment to Rule of Law","slug":"afp-joins-national-peace-walk-reaffirms-commitment-to-rule-of-law","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City -- The Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP), led by Chief of Staff General Romeo S. Brawner Jr., joined participants from government agencies, uniformed services, civil society organizations, and the public in the National Peace Walk 2026 on July 12 at the Quirino Grandstand in Ermita, Manila.","featured_image":"/media/library/2026/09/AFP_JOINS_NATIONAL_PEACE_WALK_REAFFIRMS_COMMITMENT_TO_RULE_OF_LAW.jpg","image_caption":"Despite heavy rain, members of the Philippine Army take part in the National Peace Walk 2026 in Manila on July 12, 2026. (Photo by PFC Carmelotes PN(M)/PAOAFP)","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2026-07-12T09:56:00+08:00","hits":16},{"id":1319,"title":"Beyond the Battlefield: AFP Chief Advances Troop Welfare and Community Empowerment During 4ID Visit","slug":"beyond-the-battlefield-afp-chief-advances-troop-welfare-and-community-empowerment-during-4id-visit","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City -- Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) Chief of Staff General Romeo S Brawner Jr. visited the 4th Infantry \"Diamond\" Division (4ID) at Camp Evangelista in Cagayan de Oro City on July 9.","featured_image":"/media/library/2026/09/BEYOND_THE_BATTLEFIELD_AFP_CHIEF_ADVANCES_TROOP_WELFARE_AND_COMMUNITY_EMPOWERMENT_DURING_4ID_VISIT.jpg","image_caption":"AFP Chief of Staff General Romeo S Brawner Jr., Major General Marion T Angcao, AFP senior officers and the Diamond troopers pose for a group photo during the AFP Chief's visit to Camp Evangelista in Cagayan de Oro City on July 9.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2026-07-09T09:55:00+08:00","hits":18},{"id":1318,"title":"AFP Chief Returns to His Haribon Roots Ahead of Retirement","slug":"afp-chief-returns-to-his-haribon-roots-ahead-of-retirement","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City -- Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) Chief of Staff General Romeo S Brawner Jr. visited the 103rd Infantry \"Haribon\" Brigade of the Philippine Army under the 1st Infantry \"Tabak\" Division at Kampo Ranao in Marawi City, Lanao del Sur on July 9. The visit forms part of the Chief of Staff's series of engagements with AFP units ahead of his forthcoming retirement from military service.","featured_image":"/media/library/2026/09/AFP_CHIEF_RETURNS_TO_HIS_HARIBON_ROOTS_AHEAD_OF_RETIREMENT.jpg","image_caption":"AFP Chief of Staff General Romeo S Brawner Jr., together with Colonel Jessie R Montoya, Commander of the 103rd Infantry \"Haribon\" Brigade, AFP senior officers, and officers and personnel of the 103rd Infantry Brigade, pose for a group photo during the Chief of Staff's visit to Kampo Ranao in Marawi City, Lanao del Sur on July 9.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2026-07-09T09:53:00+08:00","hits":26},{"id":1317,"title":"AFP Strengthens Healthcare Network Through Renewed MakatiMed Partnership","slug":"afp-strengthens-healthcare-network-through-renewed-makatimed-partnership","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City -- The Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) and Makati Medical Center renewed their partnership through the signing of a Memorandum of Agreement (MOA) on July 8 in Makati City, reaffirming their shared commitment to providing quality healthcare services for AFP personnel and their qualified dependents.","featured_image":"/media/library/2026/09/AFP_STRENGTHENS_HEALTHCARE_NETWORK_THROUGH_RENEWED_MAKATIMED_PARTNERSHIP.jpg","image_caption":"(From left) AFP Chief of Staff General Romeo S Brawner Jr., Makati Medical Center Foundation Chairman Manuel V. Pangilinan, and Makati Medical Center Foundation President Dr. Victor L. Gisbert lead the ceremonial signing of the renewed partnership and Memorandum of Agreement (MOA) between the Armed Forces of the Philippines and Makati Medical Center on July 8 in Makati City.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2026-07-08T09:52:00+08:00","hits":15},{"id":1316,"title":"AFP Advances Vision of a Resilient and Secure Nation at 2026 Mid-Year Command Conference","slug":"afp-advances-vision-of-a-resilient-and-secure-nation-at-2026-mid-year-command-conference","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City -- The Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) strengthened its commitment to building a resilient and secure nation during the 1st Semester CY 2026 AFP Command Conference held on July 7 at Camp Aguinaldo, led by Commander-in-Chief President Ferdinand R. Marcos Jr., where military leaders assessed the AFP’s accomplishments in the first half of 2026 and charted the strategic path toward building a resilient and secure nation.","featured_image":"/media/library/2026/09/AFP_ADVANCES_VISION_OF_RESILIENT_AND_SECURE_NATION_AT_2026_MID-YEAR_COMMAND_CONFERENCE.jpg","image_caption":"Commander-in-Chief President Ferdinand R. Marcos Jr. leads the 1st Semester CY 2026 AFP Command Conference on July 7 at Camp Aguinaldo, providing strategic guidance as the AFP strengthens unity, readiness, and commitment to national security.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2026-07-08T09:50:00+08:00","hits":47},{"id":1315,"title":"AFP Honors Stakeholders with Inaugural Golden Flame of Partnership Award","slug":"afp-honors-stakeholders-with-inaugural-golden-flame-of-partnership-award","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City -- The Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP), led by Chief of Staff General Romeo S. Brawner Jr., recognized 14 distinguished partners with the inaugural Golden Flame of Partnership Award during the flag-raising ceremony held on Monday, 06 July 2026, at the General Headquarters Canopy Area, Camp Aguinaldo.","featured_image":"/media/library/2026/09/AFP_HONORS_STAKEHOLDERS_WITH_INAUGURAL_GOLDEN_FLAME_OF_PARTNERSHIP_AWARD.jpg","image_caption":"The AFP leadership led by General Romeo S. Brawner Jr., AFP Chief of Staff stands with the stakeholder awardees and recipients of the inaugural Golden Flame of Partnership Trophies on July 7, 2026 in Camp Aguinaldo, Quezon City. (Photo by PFC Carmelotes PN(M)/PAOAFP)","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2026-07-06T09:48:00+08:00","hits":16},{"id":1314,"title":"AFP Cultivates Future-Ready Leadership Through Recognition of Merit and Distinguished Service","slug":"afp-cultivates-future-ready-leadership-through-recognition-of-merit-and-distinguished-service","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City -- The Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) reaffirmed its commitment to leadership development, organizational excellence, and inclusive recognition of service contributions during the Flag Raising Ceremony held on July 6, here. The event was presided over by AFP Chief of Staff General Romeo S Brawner Jr.","featured_image":"/media/library/2026/09/AFP_CULTIVATES_FUTURE-READY_LEADERSHIP_THROUGH_RECOGNITION_OF_MERIT_AND_DISTINGUISHED_SERVICE.jpg","image_caption":"Lieutenant General Francis Anthony M Coronel, The Inspector General, AFP, receives arrival honors prior to the donning of ranks ceremony held at Camp Aguinaldo on July 6.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2026-07-06T09:47:00+08:00","hits":16},{"id":1313,"title":"AFP Honors High-Performing Units, Advances Culture of Excellence and Good Governance","slug":"afp-honors-high-performing-units-advances-culture-of-excellence-and-good-governance","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City -- The Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) reaffirmed its commitment to organizational excellence and institutional transformation by recognizing outstanding units during the AFP Transformation Roadmap Institutionalization Pathway (AFPTRIP) Awarding as part of the Flag Raising ceremony on July 6, presided over by AFP Chief of Staff General Romeo S Brawner Jr.","featured_image":"/media/library/2026/09/AFP_HONORS_HIGH-PERFORMING_UNITS_ADVANCES_CULTURE_OF_EXCELLENCE_AND_GOOD_GOVERNANCE.jpg","image_caption":"AFP Chief of Staff General Romeo S Brawner Jr presents the AFPTRIP Recertified Status to the AFP General Headquarters and Headquarters Service Command (GHQ&HSC) led by Brigadier General Ricky A Laniog, Commander of GHQ&HSC during the AFP Transformation Roadmap Institutionalization Pathway (AFPTRIP) Awarding as part of the Flag Raising ceremony on July 6 at Camp Aguinaldo.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2026-07-06T09:46:00+08:00","hits":17},{"id":1312,"title":"AFP Reaffirms Resolve to Defend West Philippine Sea, Safeguard Nation’s Future","slug":"afp-reaffirms-resolve-to-defend-west-philippine-sea-safeguard-nations-future","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City -- The Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP), led by AFP Chief of Staff General Romeo S Brawner Jr., reaffirmed its unwavering commitment to defending the country's sovereignty as it marked the upcoming 10th anniversary of the 2016 Arbitral Ruling on the West Philippine Sea during the Flag Raising Ceremony on July 6 here.","featured_image":"/media/library/2026/09/AFP_REAFFIRMS_RESOLVE_TO_DEFEND_THE_WEST_PHILIPPINE_SEA_SAFEGUARD_NATIONS_FUTURE.jpg","image_caption":"AFP officers and personnel watch an audiovisual presentation on the West Philippine Sea (WPS), highlighting the significance of the 2016 Arbitral Ruling and reaffirming the AFP’s commitment to protecting the country's national interests during the Flag Raising Ceremony at Camp Aguinaldo on July 6.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2026-07-06T09:44:00+08:00","hits":72},{"id":1311,"title":"AFP Chief of Staff Honored in PMA Testimonial Parade and Review","slug":"afp-chief-of-staff-honored-in-pma-testimonial-parade-and-review","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City -- The Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) honored the distinguished military service and leadership of its 60th Chief of Staff, General Romeo S. Brawner Jr., as the Philippine Military Academy rendered a Testimonial Parade and Review at Borromeo Field, Fort General Gregorio H. Del Pilar, Baguio City, on July 4, 2026.","featured_image":"/media/library/2026/09/AFP_CHIEF_OF_STAFF_HONORED_IN_PMA_TESTIMONIAL_PARADE_AND_REVIEW.jpg","image_caption":"General Romeo S. Brawner Jr., AFP Chief of Staff renders a salute beside the PMA Corps of Cadets during the Testimonial Parade and Review held in recognition of his 37 years of dedicated military service in Fort Del Pilar Baguio City on July 4, 2026. (Photo by SSg Ambay PA/PAOAFP)","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2026-07-04T09:43:00+08:00","hits":48},{"id":1310,"title":"AFP Chief Honors NOLCOM Troops During Farewell Visit","slug":"afp-chief-honors-nolcom-troops-during-farewell-visit","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City -- Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) Chief of Staff General Romeo S Brawner Jr. honored outstanding military personnel of the Northern Luzon Command (NOLCOM) during his exit visit to Camp Servillano Aquino in Tarlac City on July 2. The visit formed part of his farewell engagements ahead of his retirement from military service.","featured_image":"/media/library/2026/09/AFP_CHIEF_HONORS_NOLCOM_TROOPS_DURING_FAREWELL_VISIT.jpg","image_caption":"AFP Chief of Staff General Romeo S Brawner Jr. receives arrival honors from Northern Luzon Command (NOLCOM) troops led by Lieutenant General Aristotle D Gonzalez, NOLCOM Commander, upon his arrival at Camp Servillano Aquino, Tarlac City on July 2.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2026-07-02T09:40:00+08:00","hits":58},{"id":1309,"title":"AFP Statement on the Situation related to the Reported Lightning Rally along EDSA","slug":"afp-statement-on-the-situation-related-to-the-reported-lightning-rally-along-edsa","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"","featured_image":"/media/library/2026/09/AFP_STATEMENT_ON_THE_SITUATION_RELATED_TO_THE_REPORTED_LIGHTNING_RALLY_ALONG_EDSA.jpg","image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2026-06-30T09:23:00+08:00","hits":98},{"id":1308,"title":"AFP Chief Leads SOLCOM’s 39th Founding Anniversary","slug":"afp-chief-leads-solcoms-39th-founding-anniversary","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City -- Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) Chief of Staff General Romeo S. Brawner Jr. served as the Guest of Honor and Speaker during the 39th Founding Anniversary of the Southern Luzon Command (SOLCOM) at Camp Guillermo Nakar, Lucena City, Quezon, on June 26.","featured_image":"/media/articles/AFP_CHIEF_LEADS_SOLCOMS_39TH_FOUNDING_ANNIVERSARY.jpg","image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2026-06-26T09:22:00+08:00","hits":57},{"id":1306,"title":"AFP Medical Service Marks 128 Years of Advancing Military Health Security","slug":"afp-medical-service-marks-128-years-of-advancing-military-health-security","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City -- The Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) Medical Service celebrated its 128th Founding Anniversary in a ceremony held on June 24 here, with the theme, “Empowerment on the AFP Health Security: Ensuring Responsiveness to Sustainment to Joint Operations.\"","featured_image":"/media/library/2026/09/AFP_MEDICAL_SERVICE_MARKS_128_YEARS_OF_ADVANCING_MILITARY_HEALTH_SECURITY.jpg","image_caption":"AFP Chief of Staff General Romeo S Brawner Jr. and AFP Surgeon General Brigadier General Fatima Claire S Navarro pose for a group photo with awarded AFP Medical Service officers and personnel during the 128th Founding Anniversary celebration of the AFP Medical Service on June 24 at Camp Aguinaldo.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2026-06-24T16:00:00+08:00","hits":44},{"id":1305,"title":"AFP, Royal Brunei Navy Strengthen Naval Partnership for Regional Stability","slug":"afp-royal-brunei-navy-strengthen-naval-partnership-for-regional-stability","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City -- The Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) and the Royal Brunei Navy reaffirmed their commitment to strengthening bilateral defense relations as AFP Acting Chief of Staff Lieutenant General Rommel P Roldan welcomed First Admiral Sahibul Bahari bin Haji Zainal Abidin, Commander of the Royal Brunei Navy, during a courtesy visit on June 22, here.","featured_image":"/media/articles/AFP_ROYAL_BRUNEI_NAVY_STRENGTHEN_NAVAL_PARTNERSHIP_FOR_REGIONAL_STABILITY.jpg","image_caption":"AFP Acting Chief of Staff Lieutenant General Rommel P Roldan and First Admiral Sahibul Bahari bin Haji Zainal Abidin, Commander of the Royal Brunei Navy, sit in discussion during the latter’s courtesy visit in June 22 at Camp Aguinaldo.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2026-06-23T09:03:00+08:00","hits":97},{"id":1307,"title":"AFP, USPACOM Strengthen Maritime Cooperation in Fifth MCA for 2026","slug":"afp-uspacom-strengthen-maritime-cooperation-in-fifth-mca-for-2026","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"CAMP AGUINALDO, Quezon City -- The Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) and the United States Pacific Command (USPACOM) successfully completed the fifth Philippines–United States Bilateral Maritime Cooperative Activity (MCA) for 2026 in the West Philippine Sea from June 27 to 28, reaffirming both nations' commitment to strengthening maritime cooperation and regional security.","featured_image":"/media/library/2026/09/AFP_USPACOM_STRENGTHEN_MARITIME_COOPERATION_IN_FIFTH_MCA_FOR_2026.jpg","image_caption":"Philippine Coast Guard and United States Coast Guard ships execute coordinated maneuvers in the West Philippine Sea as part of the Bilateral MCA on June 27, 2026. (Photo by PO3 Gonzales PN/PAOAFP)","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2026-06-20T09:19:00+08:00","hits":85},{"id":1304,"title":"AFP, USINDOPACOM Complete Successful Bilateral Maritime Exercise","slug":"afp-usindopacom-complete-successful-bilateral-maritime-exercise","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"","featured_image":"/media/articles/AFP_USINDOPACOM_Complete_Successful_Bilateral_Maritime_Exercise.jpg","image_caption":"BRP Melchora Aquino (MRRV 9702) sails as participating vessels execute Division Tactics (DIVTACS) maneuvers, demonstrating coordinated maritime operations and interoperability during the PH-US Bilateral Maritime Cooperative Activity in the West Philippine Sea.","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2026-06-14T15:35:56.485839+08:00","hits":3186},{"id":1303,"title":"AFP Statement On Standing in Solidarity with Defense Secretary Gilberto C. Teodoro Jr.","slug":"afp-statement-on-standing-in-solidarity-with-defense-secretary-gilberto-c-teodoro-jr","category":7,"category_name":"News Blog","category_slug":"news-blog","intro_html":"","featured_image":"/media/articles/AFP_Statement_On_Standing_in_Solidarity_with_Defense_Secretary_Gilberto_C._Teodoro_Jr..jpg","image_caption":"","is_featured":false,"published_at":"2026-06-14T15:35:02.203804+08:00","hits":1264}]}